window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>USA Today bestselling author K. A. Linde returns to the Royal Houses series with House of Gods: the story of Kerrigan Argon, a half-Fae, half-human as she seeks her place in an unforgiving world filled with magic, mayhem, and romance.</p> <p>On the other side of a portal, Kerrigan Argon lands in the home of the gods—alone.</p> <p>She's lost everything: Her family. Her magic. Her world.</p> <p>Even her dark Fae prince, Fordham Ollivier, has disappeared. She has nowhere to turn, and no idea how to survive in this new world.</p> <p>The first kind face in the crowd gives Kerrigan hope. Until her would-be helpers kidnap and deliver her into a new kind of hell and the only chance to get home—the gladiator ring.</p> <p>Win the gladiator tournament and receive a gift from the gods.</p> <p>Kerrigan is determined to gain that boon to save her people.</p>"; 
